### Transaction Items API Testing
### Prerequisites:
### 1. Start dev server: npm run dev
### 2. Sign in and get session cookie
### 3. Create a transaction first
### 4. Replace {{transactionId}} and {{itemId}} with actual IDs

###
### TEST SETUP
### First, let's create a test transaction to work with
###

### 1. Sign In (Get Session Cookie)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/signin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###
### 2. Create Test Transaction
POST http://localhost:3000/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Test Transaction for Items",
  "amount": 100000,
  "type": "EXPENSE",
  "date": "2025-11-21",
  "walletId": "YOUR_WALLET_ID_HERE",
  "categoryId": "YOUR_CATEGORY_ID_HERE"
}

# Save the transaction ID from response!

###
### TRANSACTION ITEMS TESTS
###

### 3. GET Items (Should be empty initially)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/transactions/YOUR_TRANSACTION_ID_HERE/items

###
### 4. POST - Add First Item
POST http://localhost:3000/api/transactions/YOUR_TRANSACTION_ID_HERE/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Susu Ultra 1L",
  "quantity": 2,
  "unitPrice": 15000,
  "category": "Dairy",
  "notes": "Fresh milk"
}

# Expected: Returns item object with totalPrice = 30000
# Expected: Transaction amount updated to 30000

###
### 5. POST - Add Second Item
POST http://localhost:3000/api/transactions/YOUR_TRANSACTION_ID_HERE/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Roti Tawar",
  "quantity": 3,
  "unitPrice": 12000,
  "notes": "Whole wheat bread"
}

# Expected: Returns item object with totalPrice = 36000
# Expected: Transaction amount updated to 66000 (30000 + 36000)

###
### 6. POST - Add Third Item
POST http://localhost:3000/api/transactions/YOUR_TRANSACTION_ID_HERE/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Minyak Goreng",
  "quantity": 1,
  "unitPrice": 25000
}

# Expected: totalPrice = 25000
# Expected: Transaction amount = 91000 (30000 + 36000 + 25000)

###
### 7. GET Items (Should return 3 items)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/transactions/YOUR_TRANSACTION_ID_HERE/items

# Expected: Array of 3 items ordered by 'order' field

###
### 8. PUT - Update Second Item (Change quantity)
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/transactions/YOUR_TRANSACTION_ID_HERE/items/YOUR_ITEM_ID_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Roti Tawar",
  "quantity": 5,
  "unitPrice": 12000,
  "notes": "Updated quantity"
}

# Expected: totalPrice = 60000 (5 * 12000)
# Expected: Transaction amount = 115000 (30000 + 60000 + 25000)

###
### 9. PUT - Update First Item (Change price)
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/transactions/YOUR_TRANSACTION_ID_HERE/items/YOUR_ITEM_ID_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Susu Ultra 1L",
  "quantity": 2,
  "unitPrice": 20000,
  "notes": "Price increased"
}

# Expected: totalPrice = 40000 (2 * 20000)
# Expected: Transaction amount = 125000 (40000 + 60000 + 25000)

###
### 10. DELETE - Remove Third Item
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/transactions/YOUR_TRANSACTION_ID_HERE/items/YOUR_ITEM_ID_HERE

# Expected: Success message
# Expected: Transaction amount = 100000 (40000 + 60000)

###
### 11. GET Items (Should return 2 items now)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/transactions/YOUR_TRANSACTION_ID_HERE/items

# Expected: Array of 2 items

###
### ERROR CASES
###

### 12. GET Items - Invalid Transaction ID (404)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/transactions/invalid-id-123/items

# Expected: 404 Transaction not found

###
### 13. POST Item - Missing Required Fields (400)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/transactions/YOUR_TRANSACTION_ID_HERE/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 1
}

# Expected: 400 Name and unitPrice are required

###
### 14. PUT Item - Invalid Item ID (500 or 404)
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/transactions/YOUR_TRANSACTION_ID_HERE/items/invalid-item-id
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test",
  "quantity": 1,
  "unitPrice": 1000
}

# Expected: Error

###
### 15. DELETE Item - Invalid Item ID (500 or 404)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/transactions/YOUR_TRANSACTION_ID_HERE/items/invalid-item-id

# Expected: Error
